  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialManager
  introTitle: Welcome to Hadal Descent
  introPages:
  - Welcome to the depths of the ocean. Your goal is to explore, survive, level up
    and uncover the species of the deep.
  - 'Controls:

    - Movement: W A S D  or  Arrow Keys

    - Tail Whip Attack:
    Left Click  or  ''J''

    - Open Bestiary: ''Tab''

    - Pause Game: ''Escape''

    -
    Get skills and use Active Skills by pressing the buttons on screen or pressing
    ''K'' , ''L'' , and '';'''
  - You are currently in the Sunlight Zone. Explore this area and document every
    species you find before descending deeper!
